---
description: TeleLab project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md in the repository root. For details (architecture, deploy, VPS, API, database, roadmap) read docs/DOCUMENTATION.md.

Key rules:
- Reply to the owner in Hungarian; keep UI text, code, comments and commit messages in English.
- F1 26 only (UDP Format 2026). Never commit secrets (.env) or the EA spec files (spec/).
- The UDP receive path must never block on the database; schema.sql must stay idempotent.
- Frontend is vanilla JS ES modules embedded with go:embed: no frameworks, no bundler, no CDNs; escape game/user strings with escapeHtml.
- Before committing: gofmt -l . (empty), go vet ./..., go test ./..., node --check on changed JS files.
